  "description": "Nuke build component for the Qyl OpenTelemetry semantic-conventions toolchain.\n      Exposes IUpstreamConventions (Weaver-based generator pipeline, lockstep verification) and\n      IDomainConventionsApi (downstream TypeSpec API pipeline) component interfaces, plus the\n      LockstepPolicy helper for {semconv}-{n} version-suffix parsing. The same pipeline this\n      monorepo's eng/build/ consumes to regenerate its own attribute packages — true dogfood.",
